                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "Damage bonus is additive to Faction Damage Bonuses ."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "As such, it applies a second time to Damage over Time (DoT) from status effects."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "Coaction Drift increases the strength of your aura on everyone, as well as the effectiveness of everyone's auras on yourself."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "When maxed, this increases the aura's strength to (1 + 15%) 2 = 1.3225x for yourself, and 1.15x for everyone else."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "Consequently, the companion and summon damage bonus of Summoner's Wrath is increased to 99.1875% (1.3225 × 75%, displayed as 99.19% in-game) for yourself, and 86.25% (1.15 × 75%) for squadmates."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "As such, it applies a second time to Damage over Time (DoT) from status effects."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "On beasts Immunity Resistance stacks multiplicatively with bonuses like Faction Multipliers: Summoner's Wrath and Roar ."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Summoner's Wrath",
                  "pageId": 1589150,
                  "revisionId": 2814438,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "On hounds Galvanized Elementalist or their variant Melee Elementalist stack multiplicatively with bonuses like Faction Multipliers and Roar ."
                }
              },
              {
